    "title": "Nevada Fugitive Nabbed In Long Beach After Years On The Run - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Levine ,\n5 hours ago A Nevada parole absconder who slipped out of supervision for more than three years has been hauled back to Las Vegas after authorities tracked him to southern California. Preston Jakes was arrested in Long Beach on March 13 and extradited to Nevada on March 31, returning to a case that dates back to a 2013 conviction for attempted sexual assault involving a minor. He is now being held at the Clark County Jail. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
